- [ ] CSV path comment added in `main.md` near Figure 2.
- [ ] Family colours come from `family_color()` (not hardcoded);
  legend shows EN/FR/ZH.
- [ ] Median + min/max whiskers visible per model in regenerated PDF.
- [ ] No cloud/local distinction remains in `plot_pareto.py`.
- [ ] `--xscale linear` and `--xscale log` both produce readable figures;
