- `make figures` still produces `fig_pareto.pdf` without error.
- `make exp1-cost-summary` still produces the LaTeX table for the
  report build.
- No inline pgfplots reintroduced (adherence test from 0130).
- The Python-to-PDF figure pattern is preserved (no inline plots).

## Exit criteria

- Actions 1–5 decided and either applied or recorded as "not now" in
  the ticket log.
- Action 6 follow-up ticket filed.
- `fig_pareto.pdf` regenerates cleanly with envelope and family
  colouring (if Actions 2 and 3 land).
- `main.md` Figure 2 caption no longer carries stale pilot numbers
  (Action 1 lands regardless of the other actions).
